# Fuzz corpora are generated by `cargo fuzz run` and are not checked in: they are
# large, and every run rewrites them.
#
# The exception is a crash's reproducer, which is committed to
# `fuzz/corpus/<target>/` and makes the fix permanent (`SPEC.md` §21.3). No crash
# has been found yet, so the per-target directories below do not exist yet; a
# regression is committed as `fuzz/corpus/<target>/<sha1>` when one is fixed.
*
!.gitignore
